OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 14 JAN
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GFrom St Lawrence Church, York,
OL,6,     Gwith the Ebor Singers, with music
OL,7,     Gby Richard Allain, Lucy Walker,
OL,8,     GBairstow and Buxtehude.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gottschalk
OL,10,     GDonald Macleod follows Gottschalk
OL,11,     Gas he tours Spain, before
OL,12,     Greturning to America to try and
OL,13,     Gmake his name in New York.
OL,14,G1700FIn Tune
OL,15,     GKatie Derham is joined by BBC New
OL,16,     GGeneration Artists the Astatine
OL,17,     GTrio for a live performance.And
OL,18,     Gpianist Duncan Honeybourne has a
OL,19,     Gnew album of music by Reginald
OL,20,     GRedman.
