OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 14 JAN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GRelax with a 30 minute soundscape
OL,6,     Gof classical music including
OL,7,     Gworks by Faure, Handel, Chopin
OL,8,     Gand Dvorak.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GDalia Stasevska conducts Mahler's
OL,11,     GSymphony No. 4, with soprano
OL,12,     GJoelle Harvey, while Augustin
OL,13,     GHadelich is the soloist in
OL,14,     GBarber's violin concerto.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: Five Kinds of Amadeus
OL,16,     GGeoffrey Colman speaks to Dame
OL,17,     GJane Glover about Peter Shaffer's
OL,18,     GAmadeus, and the reality of
OL,19,     GMozart's life.
