OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 14 JAN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GFergus McCreadie, sitting in all
OL,12,     Gweek for Soweto Kinch, presents
OL,13,     G'Round Midnight - a weeknight
OL,14,     Gcelebration of jazz from across
OL,15,     Gthe spectrum, with a particular
OL,16,     Gfocus on new UK music.
OL,17,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,18,     GThe WDR Symphony Orchestra,
OL,19,     Gconducted by Adam Fischer,
OL,20,     Gpresents symphonies 39, 40 and 41
OL,21,     Gone after the other in this
OL,22,     Gconcert, performed in Cologne.
